@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 240
left to right direction
title PlugIt Framework - System Architecture

rectangle "External" {
  component "External Users / Systems" as External
  component "Integrator App" as Integrator
  component "PlugIt API Client SDK" as SDK
  Integrator --> SDK : Use SDK
}

node "Internal Network (PI_ALLOWED_NETWORKS)" as Internal {
  component "PlugIt Proxy" as Proxy
  database "Proxy Data Store" as ProxyDB
  Proxy -down- ProxyDB

  package "Standalone Proxy Mail (Example Scope)" as MailPkg {
    cloud "Inbound Mail Server" as MailSrv
    component "Mail Intake" as MailIntake
    component "Auto-Response Filter" as AutoFilter
    component "Routing Token Validator\n(SHA-512 slice [30:42])" as TokenValidator
    component "Text Extractor\n(First text part)" as TextExtractor
    component "Mail Handler" as MailHandler

    MailSrv --> MailIntake
    MailIntake --> AutoFilter
    AutoFilter --> TokenValidator
    TokenValidator --> TextExtractor
    TextExtractor --> MailHandler
    MailHandler ..> MailSrv : Ack & remove on success
  }

  package "PlugIt Services" as Services {
    package "Service A" as SA {
      component "PlugIt Service A" as ServiceA
      database "Service A DB\n(MySQL/SQLite)" as DBA
      artifact "Project Config\n(config.yaml)" as SvcAConf
      artifact "Local/Private Config\n(local.yaml)" as SvcALocal
      artifact "Alembic Upgrade Files" as SvcAMig

      ServiceA -down- DBA
      ServiceA ..> SvcAConf
      ServiceA ..> SvcALocal
      ServiceA ..> SvcAMig
    }
    package "Service B" as SB {
      component "PlugIt Service B" as ServiceB
      database "Service B DB\n(MySQL/SQLite)" as DBB
      artifact "Project Config\n(config.yaml)" as SvcBConf
      artifact "Local/Private Config\n(local.yaml)" as SvcBLocal
      artifact "Alembic Upgrade Files" as SvcBMig

      ServiceB -down- DBB
      ServiceB ..> SvcBConf
      ServiceB ..> SvcBLocal
      ServiceB ..> SvcBMig
    }
  }

  Proxy --> ServiceA : PlugIt Protocol
  Proxy --> ServiceB : PlugIt Protocol
}

External --> Proxy : Access via Proxy\n(HTTP/S)
SDK --> Proxy : API Requests\n(Users, Tags, Orgs,\nMembers, Email, Forum)

note right of Proxy
- Hosts shared user experience
- Exposes main API endpoint (API_URL)
- Applies network controls (PI_ALLOWED_NETWORKS)
end note

note bottom of Services
Multiple mutually isolated services.\nEach maintains its own database and configuration.
end note

note right of ServiceA
Reads configuration:
- API_URL (Proxy endpoint)
- SQLALCHEMY_URL
- DEBUG
- PI_BASE_URL
- PI_ALLOWED_NETWORKS (where applicable)
end note

note right of SvcALocal
Private settings.\nExcluded from source control.
end note

note right of SvcAMig
Version-managed schema upgrades\n(e.g., Alembic) for maintainable evolution.
end note

note right of DBA
Provisioned externally before use (C-001).
end note

note right of SDK
Programmatic client initialized with main\nAPI endpoint URL (API_URL).
Supports categories: users, subscription tags,\norganizations, project members, email, forum topics.
end note

note right of MailPkg
Example/standalone proxy workflow:
- Auto-response suppression headers checked:
  x-auto-response-suppress, Auto-Autorespond,
  auto-submitted; Auto-Submitted != no;
  precedence/x-precedence in auto_reply, bluk, junk.
- Routing token parsed as hash:data; compute SHA-512 hex,
  take [30:42] slice and compare.
- Extract first text part as payload.
- Invoke mail handler; on success, remove message.
end note
@enduml
